     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "-    Allergic rhinitis: mainstay = intranasal corticosteroid sprays (eg fluticasone, budesonide, beclomethasone); can take ≥2 wk before symptom relief"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
