     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "-    Nasal polyps: small → topical intranasal corticosteroids; a short course of oral corticosteroids also alleviates symptoms; use after polypectomy to ⇣ risk of recurrence"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
